  "Software Details": "软件详情",
  "Personalize Your Theme Color With the Theme Customizer module of eCommerceGo, you have full control over your stores appearance. Start by selecting a theme color that aligns with your brand identity. Whether you prefer bold and vibrant hues or subtle and calming shades, this feature allows you to choose from a wide range of colors to make your store visually appealing and unique. By customizing your theme color, you create a consistent and recognizable brand experience for your customers, enhancing their engagement and loyalty.": "个性化您的主题颜色使用 eCommerceGo 的主题定制器模块，您可以完全控制您的商店外观。",
  "View Live Demo": "查看现场演示",
  "Define Your Border Color": "定义边框颜色",
  "Borders play a crucial role in defining the structure and aesthetics of your stores design. The Theme Customizer module enables you to easily customize border colors to match your chosen theme and enhance the visual hierarchy of your content. This feature allows you to make specific elements stand out or blend seamlessly with the overall design, providing a polished and professional look to your store.": "边框在定义商店设计的结构和美观方面起着至关重要的作用。",
  "Choose Your Theme White Color": "选择您的主题白色",
  "For those who prefer a clean and minimalist aesthetic, the Theme Customizer module offers the option to adjust the white color used throughout your theme. This feature allows you to select the perfect shade of white that complements your store’s design, ensuring that your content is clear, readable, and visually appealing. A well-chosen white theme color can give your store a fresh, modern look that appeals to a wide audience.": "对于那些喜欢干净简约美感的人来说，主题定制器模块提供了调整整个主题中使用的白色的选项。",
  "Customize Your Button Color": "自定义您的按钮颜色",
  "Buttons are critical for guiding users through your store, and their color plays a significant role in user experience. With the Theme Customizer module, you can easily change the button colors to ensure they stand out and encourage clicks. Choose colors that complement your theme or make bold choices to draw attention to key actions, such as adding items to a cart or completing a purchase. Customizing button colors helps improve navigation and enhances the overall functionality of your store, making it more user-friendly and visually cohesive.": "按钮对于引导用户浏览商店至关重要，其颜色在用户体验中起着重要作用。",
